No matter how much money and wealth you have, if you don't have love, you're disqualified as a husband!

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:19.120
Who are you?

00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:21.940
If you have love, your fans' ears will be delicious!

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:24.920
Even if you have a luxurious dress, you don't have to let your loved one see it!

00:17:25.400 --> 00:17:27.500
I'm fine by myself.

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:29.460
We're not trash!

00:17:30.030 --> 00:17:32.560
Kunoichi is one than two!

00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:35.930
Let's see it! From the bottom of the line!

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:38.910
You idiot!

00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:01.720
I found a gun!

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:05.920
Let's go!

00:18:06.080 --> 00:18:07.740
There's already a lot of smoke going around!

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:16.840
It's a trap!

00:18:22.300 --> 00:18:23.200
Let's look for the iron stairs!

00:18:31.020 --> 00:18:33.080
I'm coming!

00:18:33.720 --> 00:18:37.850
That hotel seems to have a lot of emergency equipment.

00:18:40.710 --> 00:18:46.860
Stop! You'll get caught in the smoke before you can get out of here!

00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:50.190
But it's full of smoke everywhere and I have nowhere else to go!

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:51.420
What?

00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:58.300
Let's go back to the kitchen!

00:19:16.028 --> 00:19:18.028
Why are you doing this to me?

00:19:24.572 --> 00:19:26.172
It's just a little smoke.

00:19:26.716 --> 00:19:28.896
The smoke went all the way back there!

00:19:31.820 --> 00:19:32.300
Is this the end?

00:19:33.550 --> 00:19:46.650
Mika!

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:47.030
Why?

00:19:51.060 --> 00:19:52.220
Mr. Hachimaki?

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:53.610
You're his wife?

00:19:54.180 --> 00:19:56.220
No, it's all thanks to him.

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:58.310
He's the one who created the Kassan Kasekkai Seiza.

00:19:58.530 --> 00:19:59.640
In short...

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:02.620
If you put the fertilizer in the water, oxygen will be generated.

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:06.050
There was a ceramic pot just in the right place.

00:20:06.230 --> 00:20:08.290
By the way, Ai-chan is an astronaut.

00:20:08.990 --> 00:20:11.620
I see. It's like a hand-made space suit.

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:15.360
All we have to do is go back the way you came, and we'll be able to escape.

00:20:15.800 --> 00:20:19.330
It's impossible. We can't go back this way either.

00:20:20.010 --> 00:20:21.290
Then, there's no escape?

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:24.280
What are you going to do in the end?

00:20:25.460 --> 00:20:26.600
No, it's okay.

00:20:26.900 --> 00:20:27.960
It's impossible for a ninja!

00:20:27.960 --> 00:20:28.580
It's not impossible for a ninja to do it!

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:32.080
You're a pro, aren't you?

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:32.980
Help your daughter!

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:34.140
Lend me your clothes!

00:20:34.840 --> 00:20:43.900
Hachinshu!

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:49.870
Ninja?

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:51.550
Could it be...

00:20:51.550 --> 00:20:55.000
Because it's 1 in 6 G, it can't be...

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:56.370
Fulin Kazan!

00:20:56.410 --> 00:20:58.300
Taiga no Kaishin!

00:21:15.420 --> 00:21:15.760
He's an idiot!

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:22.140
He's a ninja!

00:21:22.400 --> 00:21:23.800
He's a ninja!

00:21:44.300 --> 00:21:45.940
It's hard to say.

00:21:46.316 --> 00:21:49.776
As soon as you get to the ground, you gain weight at once.

00:21:50.060 --> 00:21:51.960
What the hell is going on?

00:21:54.220 --> 00:21:57.060
If you say you like me, you won't take it, right?

00:21:57.060 --> 00:21:58.100
Of course!

00:21:58.444 --> 00:21:59.984
Who's getting married?

00:22:00.090 --> 00:22:01.170
That's not enough for a little girl, is it?

00:22:01.390 --> 00:22:03.710
Father, I will make her happy.

00:22:04.470 --> 00:22:06.760
That's why you broke up with her!

00:22:06.940 --> 00:22:09.090
If you call her a ninja, it's a fraud, isn't it?

00:22:09.150 --> 00:22:10.370
Kogenta doesn't have any sense!

00:22:11.770 --> 00:22:13.950
Boss, how many months is my apartment contract?

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:16.530
Then when are you going to pay me?

00:22:16.930 --> 00:22:18.210
For the time being, two years.

00:22:18.350 --> 00:22:18.910
Because I don't have any money.

00:22:20.830 --> 00:22:21.850
How about the love of a shooting star?

00:22:23.110 --> 00:22:24.830
No, Kunoichi is a little...

00:22:24.830 --> 00:22:25.920
Don't you have a fruit knife?

00:22:26.720 --> 00:22:28.840
I have it, but...

00:22:28.930 --> 00:22:29.850
Ah, it's an interruption!

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:32.640
They say it's forbidden, but it's because my daughter is the best.

00:22:33.980 --> 00:22:41.890
Mr. Hoshino is the 49th in Ochi-Omiya, and the next one is just the 50th. Let's move on to the next one.

00:22:42.150 --> 00:22:43.210
O-Rin-chan.

00:22:43.490 --> 00:22:44.090
Shut up!

00:22:44.310 --> 00:22:45.710
NINPO Tobi Makura!

00:22:45.900 --> 00:22:47.080
NINPO Makura-dori!

00:22:47.400 --> 00:22:48.820
Makura Daishi no Jutsu-san!

00:22:48.940 --> 00:22:50.200
Makura Goma Mikki-san!

00:22:50.380 --> 00:22:51.280
Osaki Makura!

00:22:52.260 --> 00:22:52.620
Again?

00:22:53.300 --> 00:22:53.640
What?

00:22:57.510 --> 00:22:58.670
NINPO is forbidden!

00:23:00.030 --> 00:23:14.290
I want water to smoke

00:23:14.290 --> 00:23:22.010
I don't want water to smoke

00:23:22.010 --> 00:23:25.810
I don't want water to smoke

00:23:36.720 --> 00:23:41.160
Even if I fall, I'll never

00:24:34.920 --> 00:24:35.220
What's this?

00:24:35.400 --> 00:24:36.170
It's an apple.

00:24:37.090 --> 00:24:39.540
We can't live away from the Earth.

00:24:40.380 --> 00:24:41.860
That's the reality of the present.

00:24:41.960 --> 00:24:44.420
I want to see it.

00:24:44.780 --> 00:24:45.920
The sea of Chimaki.

00:24:46.920 --> 00:24:49.080
Young people these days are so naughty.

00:24:49.520 --> 00:24:51.320
It's hard to change when it's just the two of us.

00:24:51.930 --> 00:24:54.170
Don't make me retire on my own.

00:24:54.170 --> 00:24:54.830
Snob
